  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Voluntary Contribution From the Ministry of Foreign Affairs of the Republic of Uruguay to Support the Operation of the IOM Office in Uruguay and to Finance Jointly Defined Activities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to contribute to the development of migration policies within the framework of international, regional and national commitments assumed by the Uruguayan State to respect the human rights of migrants. This initiative will promote national capacities towards migration management and to contribute to strengthen the migration work at a regional level. All the activities will be coordinated with the Ministry of Foreign Affairs of Uruguay.</narrative>
  </description>
